<title>CHINA: China production of iron ore up 200,000 T in '96.</title>
<headline>China production of iron ore up 200,000 T in '96.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 249 million tonnes of iron ore in 1996, the People's Daily said on Wednesday quoting figures from the Ministry of Metallurgical Industry.</p>
<p>That marked an increase of 200,000 tonnes compared with the previous year, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>It gave no forecast of output for 1997.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
